{"lesson_id": "L001", "statement": "On 13-band EuroSAT-like data, SSL4EO-MoCo resnet18 weights beat ImageNet resnet18 by about 1.4 points in val accuracy at equal 6-min cap. Caveat: the ImageNet run also used img_size 64 vs 224, so weights and resolution are confounded. Probably because the S2-pretrained weights match the multispectral input.", "intended_scope": "Multispectral Sentinel-2 scene classification, small ResNet backbones, short training budget. Lead only; retest with matched img_size.", "group": "model", "baseline": {"backbone": "resnet18", "weights": "ssl4eo_moco"}, "intervention": {"backbone": "resnet18", "weights": "imagenet"}, "preferred": {"backbone": "resnet18", "weights": "ssl4eo_moco"}, "sign": -1, "effect": {"delta": -0.014000000000000012, "sd_boot": 0.004920973378255037, "sigma_seed": 0.007000000000000006, "sigma": 0.008556633624825529, "z": -1.6361574672756278}, "metric": "accuracy", "evidence": {"task": "m-eurosat", "session_id": "m-eurosat__main__chain", "effect_id": "m-eurosat-0010>m-eurosat-0011", "runs": ["m-eurosat-0010", "m-eurosat-0011"], "R": 6.0}, "context": null, "birth_scope": {"task_type": "classification", "sensor_family": "s2-multispectral", "band_family": "multispectral", "gsd_bucket": "(1,10]m"}, "evidence_scope": {"task_type": ["classification"], "sensor_family": ["s2-multispectral"], "band_family": ["multispectral"], "gsd_bucket": ["(1,10]m"]}, "born_on": "m-eurosat", "born_session": "m-eurosat__main__chain", "born_at": "2026-10-31T20:04:10Z", "born_status": "lead", "status": "lead", "confidence": 0.5, "tests": [], "applied_in": [], "times_applied": 0, "exceptions": [], "born_features": {"n_train": 2000, "n_classes": 10, "img_side": 64, "imbalance": 1.0}, "confirmations": [], "refutations": []}
{"lesson_id": "L002", "statement": "Lowering lr from 1e-3 to 3e-4 with SSL4EO-MoCo resnet18 raised val accuracy by about 0.8 points, probably because it preserves the pretrained features. The seed-repeat of the lr 1e-3 run scored 98.7 against 98.0, so seed noise is about as large as the effect. Treat it as weak.", "intended_scope": "Fine-tuning EO-pretrained (SSL4EO) ResNets for classification with full unfrozen backbone. Lead only; check with several seeds.", "group": "optimizer", "baseline": {"lr": 0.001}, "intervention": {"lr": 0.0003}, "preferred": {"lr": 0.0003}, "sign": 1, "effect": {"delta": 0.008000000000000007, "sd_boot": 0.0037585368562314046, "sigma_seed": 0.007000000000000006, "sigma": 0.007945224937007759, "z": 1.0068940858725237}, "metric": "accuracy", "evidence": {"task": "m-eurosat", "session_id": "m-eurosat__main__chain", "effect_id": "m-eurosat-0006>m-eurosat-0008", "runs": ["m-eurosat-0006", "m-eurosat-0008"], "R": 6.0}, "context": "eo-pretrained", "birth_scope": {"task_type": "classification", "sensor_family": "s2-multispectral", "band_family": "multispectral", "gsd_bucket": "(1,10]m"}, "evidence_scope": {"task_type": ["classification"], "sensor_family": ["s2-multispectral"], "band_family": ["multispectral"], "gsd_bucket": ["(1,10]m"]}, "born_on": "m-eurosat", "born_session": "m-eurosat__main__chain", "born_at": "2026-10-31T20:04:10Z", "born_status": "lead", "status": "lead", "confidence": 0.5, "tests": [], "applied_in": [], "times_applied": 0, "exceptions": [], "born_features": {"n_train": 2000, "n_classes": 10, "img_side": 64, "imbalance": 1.0}, "confirmations": [], "refutations": []}
